<title>UK: Ldn gold fixed just softer, PGMs tick lower.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold fixed just softer, PGMs tick lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes barely changed at $343.75 versus $344.00 AM. Quiet, tightly rangebound.</p>
<p>SILVER - Down four cents at $4.78/$4.80.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Eases to $447.00/$452.00, down $17. Coming off last week's highs, helped lower by news that Russia's Almaz should get export licence this week.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Also lower at $203.50/$208.50, off $17.50.</p>
</text>
